AltoRewardsOracle::updatePrice()
├── given oracle is not initiated
│   └── when lastPriceUpdateTimestamp is zero
│       └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleNotInitiated
└── given oracle is initiated
    └── when lastPriceUpdateTimestamp is greater than zero
        ├── given cooldown period has not passed
        │   └── when block.timestamp - lastPriceUpdateTimestamp < priceUpdateCooldownPeriod
        │       └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleTooEarlyToUpdatePrice
        └── given cooldown period has passed
            └── when block.timestamp - lastPriceUpdateTimestamp >= priceUpdateCooldownPeriod
                ├── it should read new price from Uniswap using _readUniswapQuote
                ├── it should update cachedPrice to the new price
                ├── it should update lastPriceUpdateTimestamp to current block timestamp
                └── it should emit PriceUpdated event with timestamp, newPrice, and oldPrice
